        <p><b>Folder:</b> <code>OtherTests/SupportTests</code></p>
        <p><b>Description:</b> Validates that the evaluation score shown in Client Management matches the one in the client’s Dashboard and Evaluations page.</p>
        <p><b>Priority:</b> High</p>
        <p><b>Owner:</b> QA Team</p>
        <p><b>Tags:</b> regression, evaluation, data-integrity, client-management</p>
